  m_text: 'Amy (F;5) loves her teddy bear, but it''s a bit hard to fit in due to
    her age

    Lily (F;8) is very energetic but careless and requires attention

    Edward
    (M;7) is sensitive and needs attention, and is very smart

    Fin (M;8) is hard
    to open up, but kind and caring

    Phil (M;10), a born leader, or maybe because
    he is the oldest, can help with the children

'
